== Overview ==
The '''Dual Flying Buzzsaw Toilet''' is a fast [[Enemies|Enemy]] with a lot of health that can stun units. It appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and in [[Endless Mode]].

== Appearance ==
It has two arms with buzzsaws at the ends, a jetpack and heavy duty vision goggles.

